    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="725bce7b-241b-58be-9a9c-159d1b0de3d3" activityNameId="b0141065-6ab1-5ed7-a550-34ee84aedf61" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Metal working machine operation, process heat from natural gas</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Metal working machine operation, process heat from natural gas
1 kg of this process is needed to produce 1 kg of final product. The data is an estimation based on the average consumption of factories separated into process specific (included here) and ancillary processes (included in metal working factory operation).;
UUID: 361dc753-4cd1-3934-b026-cb269e2c197a
This dataset includes the materials, energies and emissions related to the machines used for machining metal products. This is mainly electricity, compressed air and solvents. Process heat is from natural gas.
Location: Average data from several local to global sized companies. The main focus is on Germany and Europe.
Technology: The companies are expected to cover the whole range of metal working.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_361dc753-4cd1-3934-b026-cb269e2c197a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
